Generated-code transformations are inspired by the CPU passes in
VasilkovND/dantes-inferno-nx, which credits gears2-nx:
https://github.com/VasilkovND/dantes-inferno-nx/tree/main/dante/tools
The inline helpers follow patch_inline_calls.py. localize_regs.cjs uses the
register-localization method described in dante/CPU_OPTIMIZATION.md and
gow2/CPU_OPTIMIZATION.md. Its dataflow, synchronization at forward joins and
startup dispatch are implemented for Mini Ninjas. The optional guest-stack
memory pass is not used.
